  "bio": "Kisuco, based in São Vicente, Brazil, is renowned for their versatile tattooing skills, specializing in watercolor, traditional, and floral designs that capture the essence of each style with dazzling proficiency. Whether you're seeking a vibrant watercolor piece, a time-honored traditional tattoo, or an intricately detailed floral pattern, Kisuco's artistry is sure to surpass your expectations, leaving you with a work of art that celebrates the rich tapestry of tattoo traditions. With a reputation for stellar cleanliness, clients can relax in the knowledge that their experience will be conducted with the utmost attention to hygiene and safety, ensuring a comfortable and reassuring visit each time.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: São Vicente, Sao Paulo, Brazil",
